<title>EGYPT: EGYPT OFFERS 182-DAY T-BILLS WORTH 700 MLN POUNDS.</title>
<headline>EGYPT OFFERS 182-DAY T-BILLS WORTH 700 MLN POUNDS.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 182-day treasury bills worth 700 million pounds for auction on Aug 11 and issue on Aug 12 when 182-day bills worth 767.800 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 8.825 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
</text>
